<title>NETHERLANDS: TABLE - ALANHERI H1 PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ALANHERI H1 PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     0.63 vs   0.20</p>
<p>    Turnover			     124.2  vs 119.1 </p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.65 vs   1.25</p>
<p>NOTE - Agricultural trader Alanheri NV reiterated it</p>
<p>expected a higher profit for the full of 1997 compared to the</p>
<p>net profit of 1.51 million guilders in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
